      "answer": "The English JD lists the following preferred qualifications beyond the core requirements:\n\n1. Experience shipping RAGAS or custom LLM-as-a-judge evaluation pipelines, including awareness of metric definitions and evaluation pitfalls.\n2. Production experience with function calling, multi-agent collaboration, and agent memory.\n3. Familiarity with DeepSeek, Qwen, and other Chinese LLM APIs exposing OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and with sampling parameters such as temperature and top_p.\n4. Experience optimizing LLM application cost and latency via caching, model tiering, prompt compression, and streaming.\n5. Experience with Kubernetes and observability tools such as OpenTelemetry or Langfuse."
